 return<div className="portal-page"><header className="portal-header"><Logo dark/><div><Link to="/">Main Website</Link><Link to="/login">Sign In</Link></div></header><div className="portal-center"><h1>Welcome to KNOWVA</h1><p>Every account has one of three roles. In the full system, your role will be determined automatically after sign-in.</p><div className="portal-cards">{cards.map(([role,title,desc,Icon])=><div key={role} className={'portal-card '+(role==='admin'?'portal-admin':'')}><div className="portal-ico"><Icon size={34}/></div><h2>{title}</h2><p>{desc}</p><Button onClick={()=>go('/login?demo='+role)} variant={role==='admin'?'light':'outline'}>Preview Demo <ArrowRight size={15}/></Button></div>)}</div><p className="portal-security">S E C U R E D &nbsp; B Y &nbsp; K N O W V A &nbsp; U N I V E R S I T Y &nbsp; S Y S T E M S</p><small>Role selection is for this frontend demo only. The production login will not ask for a role.</small></div></div>
